1753..1826 Comment "/// A relay sends the root the worker\'s peer, and the clause abandons the"
1827..1905 Comment "/// root\'s rest before it takes that end. The root\'s cancelled end cancels the"
1906..1986 Comment "/// end queued at it, and the worker\'s waiting receive then abandons the worker."
